      'Place the cards from your hand on the grid. Ace counts 1, picture cards and tens count 10. A row or column scores when its total hits the target (15 on the small square, 21 on the big one; later the diagonals count too). Reach the required number of lines with every card placed. Tap a placed card to move it, or tap your hand to take it back.',
